      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغامسا</span></b>  <i>They two vied,</i> or <i>contended, each
with the other, in plunging,</i> or <i>diving,</i> in water;
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَاقَلَا</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَغَاطَسَا</span>. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غطس</span>.)

